Package: opengwasr
Title: Client for OpenGWAS Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gibran", "Hemani", email = "g.hemani@bristol.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("University of Bristol", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Query OpenGWAS Analyses, Associations, top hits and linkage
    disequilibrium (LD), either through the OpenGWAS API or from Store
    Releases downloaded to a local machine.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://opengwas.github.io/opengwasr/, https://github.com/opengwas/opengwasr
BugReports: https://github.com/opengwas/opengwasr/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    rlang
Suggests:
    httptest2,
    knitr,
    reticulate (>= 1.41),
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    webfakes,
    withr
SystemRequirements: Optional, for a Local Source only: Python (>= 3.12)
    with the ogquery package, which reticulate sets up with uv on first
    use when no Python is chosen.
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/testthat/parallel: true
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
